  "content": "<div>zoho 企业邮箱是非常好的企业邮箱方案，优点很多：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>便宜，一年 100 块人民币。</li>\n<li>无限域名。</li>\n</ul>\n<div>缺点就是配置比较复杂，飞哥社群已经有一篇手把手的教程了：\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/god5n16uv9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/god5n16uv9</a></div>\n<div>但是，我觉得概念上还可以再写一篇梳理一下。</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Zoho</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Mail</span><span> 架构示意图（单人公司版）\n</span>│\n<span>├── 👑 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Super</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Administrator（本人）</span><span>\n</span><span>│      • 使用个人邮箱注册（如 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Gmail）</span><span>\n</span>│      • 管理所有域名与邮箱配置\n<span>│      • 管理 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DNS</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">MX</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">SPF</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DKIM</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">DMARC</span><span>\n</span><span>│      • 管理订阅与 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">License（仅</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1</span><span> 个）\n</span>│\n<span>└── 📦 唯一的 </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Mailbox</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Address（主邮箱账户）</span><span>\n</span><span>       → user@main</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span>       │\n       ├─ 🌐 绑定的多个域名\n<span>       │    ├─ main</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span><span>       │    ├─ brand</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>a</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span><span>       │    └─ brand</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>b</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">ai</span><span>\n</span>       │\n<span>       └── ✉️ </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Email</span><span> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\">Alias（跨域别名地址）</span><span>\n</span><span>             ├─ hi@main</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span><span>             ├─ support@main</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span><span>             ├─ hello@brand</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>a</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span><span>             ├─ contact@brand</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>a</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span>\n</span><span>             ├─ team@brand</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>b</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">ai</span><span>\n</span><span>             └─ info@brand</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>b</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">ai</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>📩 所有以上邮件地址（alias）→ 都进入同一个邮箱收件箱（user@main</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span>domain</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com）</span><span>\n</span>📤 发信时可选择任一 alias 作为发件地址（根据客户品牌域名区分）\n</code></div></pre>\n<table><thead><tr><th>概念</th><th>示例</th><th>说明</th><th>权限与作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Super Admin</strong></td><td>（系统最高管理员账户）</td><td>管理整个组织，包括域名配置、用户账户、群组、策略、安全设置等。</td><td>拥有对所有域名和邮箱账户的完全控制权限。</td></tr><tr><td><strong>User Account（用户账户）</strong></td><td>（组织中的一个成员）</td><td>每个成员拥有一个独立账户和主邮箱（Mailbox Address），可登录 Webmail、App、客户端等。</td><td>仅能管理自己邮箱的设置。</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Domain（域名）</strong></td><td>yourcompany.com、brand.co、project.net</td><td>组织可绑定多个域名；每个域名下可创建多个用户与别名地址。</td><td>Super Admin 可统一管理多个域名；普通用户仅限使用所属域名。</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mailbox Address（主邮箱地址）</strong></td><td><a href=\"mailto:user@yourcompany.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">user@yourcompany.com</a></td><td>每个用户的唯一信箱地址。邮件最终都会进入此信箱，无论使用哪个 alias。</td><td>唯一、固定、不可重复。系统将此作为邮件存储与认证的主入口。</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Email Alias（邮箱别名）</strong></td><td><a href=\"mailto:info@yourcompany.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">info@yourcompany.com</a>、<a href=\"mailto:hello@brand.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">hello@brand.co</a>、<a href=\"mailto:support@project.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">support@project.net</a></td><td>同一个用户在一个或多个域名下可以拥有多个别名。邮件发往任何别名都会送达主信箱。</td><td>可对外展示不同品牌或部门身份，不增加信箱存储占用。</td></tr></tbody></table>",
